 \mathrm{Ni}^{2+}+4 \mathrm{CN}^{-} \longrightarrow\left[\mathrm{Ni}(\mathrm{CN})_4\right]^{2-} \text {. Here } \mathrm{Ni}^{2+} \text { has } d^8 \text { configuration with } \mathrm{CN}^{-} \text {as strong ligand. }
